            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "claudia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for a baby shower and surround it with fruit and it was hit! The only change I made was instead of just plain cream cheese (which I already made once and was also great) I used cream cheese but chesse cake filling flavor, it added so much more flavor and I used a little more pinapple juice but it was great.",
            "datePublished": "2008-01-06T11:22:49.440Z"
